data_network_demo
#
# Warm-up for the heterogeneity extension: two serines (34 and 39) on one short poly-ALA
# chain that flip together as one network (net_1 = both in A, net_2 = both in B). The parent
# chain is single-conformer (altloc '.') so it stays visible; only the two OG/CB side chains
# carry the A/B alternates. Companion to the reconciliation memo.
#
